#
#
# This toolbox scans a Batocera PS4 roms directory for .pkg files, groups every
# package sharing a title id, and converts each game into a shadPS4 .zar
# (ZArchive) named "<game name> (<region>) [version] [TITLEID].zar".
#
# Base game and updates are merged into the archive (shadPS4 overlays a patch
# onto /app0 anyway); DLC is written as folders under <roms>/DLC/<TITLEID>/,
# which is the addon install dir the shadPS4 generator configures, because
# shadPS4 only detects additional content in real directories.
#
# PKG parsing and key derivation follow shadPS4's own implementation
# (src/core/file_format/pkg.cpp, src/core/crypto/crypto.cpp), and the .zar
# writer the ZArchive format shadPS4 vendors as externals/zarchive.
#
# Ported from https://github.com/aderumier/shadps4_pkg_to_zar for BATOCERA.
#

